                               <span id="spneligibilityinwords"> 30  September 2024</span></b> i.e. <u>only a person who is 'Insured person' as per the Act on <span id="spneligibility">30/09/2024</span></u> would be eligible for availing benefit under the 'Seats allocated for wards of insured persons(IPs)'
                               for his/her child/children.
                           </span>

                        </td>
